  "worked_solution": "To determine the distance between Charlie and Sophia, we must calculate the difference between Sophia's location and Charlie's location. This gives\n\n$$\n2.5-(-14.2)=2.5+14.2=16.7\\,\\text{m}.\n$$\n\nThus, Sophia is located $16.7\\,\\text{m}$ above Charlie.",
